{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_07ab85a9f1f1bf766913f005ed2ae66429422fa03553b37967cf2e9f44d11c29","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"qwenlm/qwen-agent@31a4d36d1236 snapshot 7bb51c83562efe20","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0930cb9272e003f43ce8bd34e866f302cfeaa37e56f78f95dca2770e64643169","slc_6b8580b1bddf5b07e2f14b22a08f0ac3b4bc37a601124fbf0d83ad80e99cdaab","slc_e3d93852d3a89d72837eefd178966483be9194bd6c4f9e19c7a62b95c90d9a23","slc_ff0eb3249a8f46e287bc5e6fb644000814db99aa6c01f2c8c7ad3bde60012148"],"source_ids":["src_365df57ed3b7532a8922e9321c6a3f91"],"text":"The package installs from PyPI as qwen-agent with optional extras [gui,rag,code_interpreter,mcp], or editable from source; MCP examples additionally require uv, git, and sqlite3.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_10d3ae5c94869fb6987477a1f4db977efd9dca8e1eb6f5ac5dbe4da88f14593a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"qwenlm/qwen-agent@31a4d36d1236 snapshot 7bb51c83562efe20","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2ecb602a1e016c629900e60876363ca62c53ef2cffecbf6cfe6fed2a08ab203d","slc_d9686629e95f20689a43ca0bad52904ea4a49ed05929edfa6086c926fdbc330c"],"source_ids":["src_365df57ed3b7532a8922e9321c6a3f91"],"text":"The default tool-calling template natively supports parallel function calls, and agent classes such as FnCallAgent and ReActChat are built on the function calling capability.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4fe0340659d2bfaa557d28db862f0e366f56fb7723ac60155707b6e523d07323","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"qwenlm/qwen-agent@31a4d36d1236 snapshot 7bb51c83562efe20","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4092a046452aaf731717908e5a6988b2cc845ebc553774a6a23f62b47dc64155"],"source_ids":["src_365df57ed3b7532a8922e9321c6a3f91"],"text":"Qwen-Agent is a framework for developing LLM applications leveraging Qwen's instruction following, tool usage, planning, and memory capabilities, and it serves as the backend of Qwen Chat.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5055cd059ff7009563a7b881c90866936bdd11bfefdf1a9f26ab32bf5f99e164","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"qwenlm/qwen-agent@31a4d36d1236 snapshot 7bb51c83562efe20","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7386eeab05c0b3674ac78f8ba8a2e3626b6a6e6cfc08bc138ee947a2d8223160"],"source_ids":["src_365df57ed3b7532a8922e9321c6a3f91"],"text":"MCP servers are configured through an mcpServers JSON structure specifying command and args, e.g. npx-based memory and filesystem servers or a uvx sqlite server.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_55d9bc175bb42f30328da7645454bbf48fa02c3e7c0ef6a021ce831cc3066069","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"qwenlm/qwen-agent@31a4d36d1236 snapshot 7bb51c83562efe20","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_603831b4789e37c212cb555d52d72047960d29007cb85f8cb7aabc831997ca62","slc_681666633864bd81dc7a982402b33b755fa40b6de93570a974c7922e9c84cb55"],"source_ids":["src_365df57ed3b7532a8922e9321c6a3f91"],"text":"The project released the DeepPlanning agent evaluation benchmark (Jan 2026) and links a benchmark page in its README.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6d2b941b6fa2bae7b1942b43199b5b45d74eee970de019555dbcab8478bc526c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"qwenlm/qwen-agent@31a4d36d1236 snapshot 7bb51c83562efe20","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_90e9724ee943581b1bab9752090d01a1ff1e1574dfdad7b2ebd5bd99886b12cd"],"source_ids":["src_365df57ed3b7532a8922e9321c6a3f91"],"text":"The Docker-based code interpreter implements only basic sandbox isolation and mounts only the specified working directory, so the docs advise caution when using it in production environments.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8685ead407712b0b4785cc14f9cd31635c292e5e00e072ffcdfbaf888ac42371","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"qwenlm/qwen-agent@31a4d36d1236 snapshot 7bb51c83562efe20","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_31bc5f37faf0b6c45f38b62997b498ffc100bb9d8aa3cc3f21cf5795926dfe77","slc_4c1a2c0be6d473d6ad9ce941032435e36fc0856bf9d12b32d17c5d0e897300ca","slc_9c98ab154dd13d16968484d0866df741378831580f6b5aa03fbb313e47bf8238","slc_f2557513a666b2535c5d6990a6dc07b8cbfc7549b3aae7638d5e7e0802de5890"],"source_ids":["src_365df57ed3b7532a8922e9321c6a3f91"],"text":"Agents are configured via an llm_cfg dict with keys such as model, model_type, model_server, api_key, and generate_cfg; both DashScope and OpenAI-compatible services (e.g. vLLM, Ollama) are supported.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9dff9aaf949c5a2c01dd7d7d6bea0d802d4ee5889fbf0e9c11466c7ea5c9d941","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"qwenlm/qwen-agent@31a4d36d1236 snapshot 7bb51c83562efe20","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1250789b0ee148302abb0d70256e284047d52be249fbb248be3b095b457821d0","slc_636c63af7882b3b16fb455026f22f8ae03d9ede8001bcfc9c0e4a271658974da"],"source_ids":["src_365df57ed3b7532a8922e9321c6a3f91"],"text":"Custom tools are registered with a @register_tool decorator, defining a description, a parameters schema, and a call() method that parses LLM-generated arguments.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a8a8e2091af5f22234d07ce2148f66bcd85567404f32d21232d36e6879be51c3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"qwenlm/qwen-agent@31a4d36d1236 snapshot 7bb51c83562efe20","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d99bc5e47d12ab506ff820f7576ff2bc5bae7396c7b49536b66992e8c921d01d"],"source_ids":["src_365df57ed3b7532a8922e9321c6a3f91"],"text":"The framework provides atomic components — LLMs inheriting from BaseChatModel and Tools inheriting from BaseTool — plus higher-level Agents derived from class Agent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c293aebf2a893059b8891ff980550c58ad1df936ec2c795140ba4fb773a239be","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"qwenlm/qwen-agent@31a4d36d1236 snapshot 7bb51c83562efe20","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_81246d5c159515c022a733d5aef30e4ed6c8271f5b7d13a20e660e9e6302cd92","slc_ba3e6e1b43cf5b35b94215971426de937e557a5f1fd9fa9d04453e701b5e2ff6"],"source_ids":["src_365df57ed3b7532a8922e9321c6a3f91"],"text":"The Assistant agent accepts llm, system_message, function_list, and files arguments, and agents run via bot.run(messages=...) as a generator yielding streaming responses.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cb5b056f5baa9a35d81f8d482d2162cdc3d6af41a77f4f6bc195011e4eb6e3cd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"qwenlm/qwen-agent@31a4d36d1236 snapshot 7bb51c83562efe20","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_603831b4789e37c212cb555d52d72047960d29007cb85f8cb7aabc831997ca62","slc_826a7d177346202e6146c411f45ab90a1621f0eb50929c70f89b995321a66f55","slc_eff23166d6b9dc9450818d8c16cd0b1a37115063e597c122b854b7dcdeb212b2"],"source_ids":["src_365df57ed3b7532a8922e9321c6a3f91"],"text":"A Gradio-based WebUI (qwen_agent.gui.WebUI) enables rapid deployment of chat interfaces for agents; per the Gradio 5 upgrade note, the GUI requires Python 3.10 or higher.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c3b9be7f79164b5a882dece071efc4fe"}
